      t=3/8: binders=[3, 5]
      t=5/8: binders=[3, 5]
      t=7/8: binders=[1, 7]
  n/2 ever a binder of AP_n? False    unique binder? False
  M(R_n)=M(AP_n\{4}) = 1/4 = 0.250000   (1/(n-1)=1/7=0.142857)
      argmax t = {1/4, 3/4}
        t=1/4: binders=[1, 3, 5, 7]   ||(n/2)t||=0
        t=3/4: binders=[1, 3, 5, 7]   ||(n/2)t||=0
  n/2 LOAD-BEARING (M(AP)<M(R))? True    dist of n/2 at R-optima: [Fraction(0, 1)]

